From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan <ryan@esterlines.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:08:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: Farble font enumeration with a whitelist and 1-in-20
 extras

Named system families that are not on the generic/bundled/fallback
whitelist are allowed only with probability 1/20 from the ESO seed.
Rejected names behave as missing in font matching, src:local(), and
FontFaceSet.check. URL @font-face is unchanged.
